    "text": "package Ops is\n   function Div_Op (A, B : Integer)\n                    return Integer is\n     (A / B);\n\n   function Rem_Op (A, B : Integer)\n                    return Integer is\n     (A rem B);\n\n   function Mod_Op (A, B : Integer)\n                    return Integer is\n     (A mod B);\nend Ops;\n\nwith Ops; use Ops;\n\nprocedure Show_Division_Check is\n   I : Integer;\nbegin\n   I := Div_Op (10, 0);\n   I := Rem_Op (10, 0);\n   I := Mod_Op (10, 0);\nend Show_Division_Check;\n",
